I'm not looking for funding. I'm not looking for a co-founder.&lt;br&gt;
I'm looking for 3 platform engineers who are tired of the same problems I described. Who want to try a different approach. Who are willing to give honest feedback — what works, what's broken, what's missing. If that's you, you can explore the full product right now without signing up. There's demo data showing governed blueprints, deployed stacks, drift alerts, and cost tracking. You can even deploy a real static website to AWS in 30 seconds — for free, no account needed. Or if you're the type who wants to talk to a human: my linkedin is open.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The product is live at app.askarchie.io. The landing page is askarchie.io. If you're an architect or platform engineer who nodded while reading this — I built it for us.&lt;/p&gt;

